    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "The composer has a cohesive cyber-defense aesthetic, disciplined cyan/pink semantics, strong ALLOW/BLOCK hierarchy, and clean responsive stacking. It falls short of demo-ready polish because mobile text and labels are frequently tiny, the long mobile result panel feels dense, and the tablet/mobile headers expose clipped horizontal navigation with distracting underlying page text; the desktop header is also visually overcrowded.",
